      "text": "Wildfire Rhythm: Sweeping Fervor's swing DMG decreases opponent's Physical RES by 15% for 12s."
    },
    {
      "level": 5,
      "effects": [],
      "text": "Screamin' for an Encore: Increases the Level of Riff Revolution by 3.\nMaximum upgrade level is 15."
    },
    {
